        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                "word": "tenure",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "21063cc4-4d1f-4608-81b7-04a40ee4812d",
                        "entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "tenures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4117933e-9878-38ea-be6e-3e849141285f",
                        "entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Terre concédée à une personne non noble par un seigneur, en retenant la propriété pour n’accorder que la jouissance précaire au concessionnaire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ace8eeba-f147-4e71-b1a7-01ba55f0eac3",
                                "sense_id": "4117933e-9878-38ea-be6e-3e849141285f",
                                "text": "Les tenures sont des terres accordées par le seigneur aux paysans. En échange de leurs terres, les paysans fournissent le cens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0f98ddd-6634-4e92-9eac-3245308c0027",
                                "sense_id": "4117933e-9878-38ea-be6e-3e849141285f",
                                "text": "Le seigneur foncier morcela son domaine, concéda en tenure chacune de ses parcelles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e8d0264-21fe-3580-bc84-fe62a36c7aa5",
                        "entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mode de possession d’une terre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dd07b72-05e8-4f61-9ae8-d09aef3d4dc0",
                                "sense_id": "9e8d0264-21fe-3580-bc84-fe62a36c7aa5",
                                "text": "La principale différence entre ces deux formes de tenure semble résider dans le fait que la première dépendait directement du roi, alors que la seconde relevait des autorités locales."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a7ff5be-7876-4a4b-8256-15649afc98d6",
                                "sense_id": "9e8d0264-21fe-3580-bc84-fe62a36c7aa5",
                                "text": "Le capital humain thésaurisé par des sociétés lignagères a longtemps été la force motrice de l’histoire africaine, y compris dans son déni et sa négation que furent l’esclavage et les traites, tandis que la terre et sa tenure étaient au cœur de l’histoire européenne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af4dc0c3-f3fd-492b-9fdb-625f5f9fbc9b",
                                "sense_id": "9e8d0264-21fe-3580-bc84-fe62a36c7aa5",
                                "text": "La tenure peut être en franc-alleu ou en fief."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6085e162-ef13-4880-8c13-5b8867b76d6b",
                                "sense_id": "9e8d0264-21fe-3580-bc84-fe62a36c7aa5",
                                "text": "La tenure en censive, que possède un tenancier, est soumise au paiement de droits seigneuriaux."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "086bd26a-97a4-3811-bcf2-d1c1bd1d7196",
                        "entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mouvance, dépendance d’un fief."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0531ba32-b4af-4afa-ab2a-b752cb8b6e1a",
                                "sense_id": "086bd26a-97a4-3811-bcf2-d1c1bd1d7196",
                                "text": "Cette terre était dans la tenure, de la tenure de tel comté, de tel duché."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4fcbeaca-cf90-3e55-8f92-8b30c24c9ddc",
                        "entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Exploitation agricole en fermage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1be2476d-e3bc-4e4d-9c0f-32c01593675e",
                                "sense_id": "4fcbeaca-cf90-3e55-8f92-8b30c24c9ddc",
                                "text": "Tu es brave, hardi compagnon, adroit. Tu ne songes pas encore à t'établir, je veux dire à te marier, à te fixer dans une tenure ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "53ff2a0c-1138-4178-8183-0e37277b9616",
                        "source_entry_id": "4255fe6c-1510-34aa-ab24-1f832b92b2c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "tenure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tenure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14d1b187-c697-32aa-95dc-06e2e0eb7b20",
                                        "entry_id": "7c188011-f081-34da-8a21-85edb5158971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A status of possessing a thing or an office; an incumbency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "374729d0-b43a-4b3f-94a1-c2ea75c6804b",
                                                "sense_id": "14d1b187-c697-32aa-95dc-06e2e0eb7b20",
                                                "text": "All that seems thine own, / Held by the tenure of his will alone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a4b06e9-85ba-44ca-9099-fb1c75b296d6",
                                                "sense_id": "14d1b187-c697-32aa-95dc-06e2e0eb7b20",
                                                "text": "It will be rather entertaining to watch Merriman when he first faces the Transport Select Committee, with his former colleagues likely to be merciless in their questioning. During his tenure, Merriman was pretty sharp, which was no bad thing, and they will make sure he gets a dose of his own medicine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e9d5d56-2c48-4d25-9abf-137c25c0cfa5",
                                                "sense_id": "14d1b187-c697-32aa-95dc-06e2e0eb7b20",
                                                "text": "Carsley ended his six-game tenure as England's interim manager in the same way he started it, with a comfortable victory over the nation he represented with distinction as a player."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32f7525f-dc5c-3ce5-9721-96cd61786f0b",
                                        "entry_id": "7c188011-f081-34da-8a21-85edb5158971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A period of time during which something is possessed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0215ea4-62d1-3ce5-8a95-4385721e603a",
                                        "entry_id": "7c188011-f081-34da-8a21-85edb5158971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A status of having a permanent post with enhanced job security within an academic institution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
